{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1592","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Bored Bakry"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Bakry got bored of solving problems related to xor, so he asked you to solve this problem for him."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a$$$ of $$$n$$$ integers $$$[a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call a subarray $$$a_{l}, a_{l+1}, a_{l+2}, \\ldots, a_r$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$a_l \\, \\& \\, a_{l+1} \\, \\& \\, a_{l+2} \\, \\ldots \\, \\& \\, a_r \\gt a_l \\oplus a_{l+1} \\oplus a_{l+2} \\ldots \\oplus a_r$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" and $$$\\&$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise AND operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the length of the longest good subarray of $$$a$$$, or determine that no such subarray exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^6$$$) — the length of the array."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^6$$$) — elements of the array."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the length of the longest good subarray. If there are no good subarrays, print $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n5 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n2 4 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n8 1 3 3 1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first case, the answer is $$$2$$$, as the whole array is good: $$$5 \\& 6 = 4 \\gt 5 \\oplus 6 = 3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third case, the answer is $$$4$$$, and one of the longest good subarrays is $$$[a_2, a_3, a_4, a_5]$$$: $$$1\\& 3 \\& 3 \\&1 = 1 \\gt 1\\oplus 3 \\oplus 3\\oplus 1 = 0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1592E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1592/problem/E"}